WEBVTT

NOTE
Disc 2 - Scene 30h: Full Time Compression Sequence
Duration: ~46 seconds
The Collapse of Time - A Surreal Nightmare Landscape
For blind and low-vision players using screen readers

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Space and time collapse into a surreal and terrifying kaleidoscope. The party finds itself 
caught between infinite versions of reality, each one fragmenting and reforming around them. 
The compression is overwhelming — a sensory nightmare of conflicting environments and 
impossible physics.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
The party runs forward through shifting landscapes, driven by pure determination and 
instinct. One moment they stand on a barren, cracked plain under a dimly glowing sky. The 
earth is dead and lifeless, cracked into a thousand fissures.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
The landscape transforms. A twisted cityscape rises around them — towering buildings of 
warped metal and glass spiral upward at sickening angles. The architecture is alien and 
wrong, defying structural logic. Streets exist where there should be sky, and the ground 
above their heads seems to rain debris downward.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
The city crumbles to nothing. The party is thrust into a void of pure color and light — 
swirling patterns of crimson, violet, and electric blue that have no physical form. They 
run through this abstract space, their bodies still moving even though there is nothing to 
stand upon.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Buildings rise from the void in seconds, towering monuments of steel and stone. They stand 
for mere moments before crumbling to dust, collapsing inward and disappearing. The cycle 
repeats endlessly and chaotically — creation and destruction happening at an impossible pace.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
The sky cycles rapidly through states — blazing daylight, absolute darkness, auroras of 
strange colors that have no names, perpetual twilight. Stars appear and disappear. The moon 
rises and sets in seconds. Storm clouds gather and dissipate in the blink of an eye.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.000
The party pushes forward with unwavering determination. Squall leads them deeper into the 
compression, his face set with resolve. Behind him, Rinoa, Zell, Quistis, Selphie, and 
Irvine follow, each struggling against the reality-warping madness surrounding them.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.000
The ground beneath them becomes increasingly unstable. One moment it is stone, the next 
flesh-like and organic, then sand, then something unidentifiable. The landscape shifts not 
around them, but beneath them, as if the world itself is breathing and shifting with 
every heartbeat.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:46.000
They pass through what feels like centuries in mere moments — through ages of history, 
through events that have already happened and events that will never be. The compression 
pushes them forward toward Ultimecia's era, toward the final confrontation. The party's 
unwavering resolve is their only anchor in the chaos.
